---
// What crosses the boundary between your device and the rest of the system. Used in "The Answer Was Already in the Weights".
---

<figure class="diagram">
  <div class="zones">
    <div class="zone mine">
      <p class="label">Your device</p>
      <div class="box">Your state<small>messages, finances, history</small></div>
      <span class="link" aria-hidden="true">↕</span>
      <div class="box gate">Your Translator<small>the sovereign gatekeeper</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wire">
      <p><span>typed question + throwaway token</span> <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></p>
      <p><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">←</span> <span>typed answer</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="zone public">
      <p class="label">Everything else</p>
      <div class="box">Does the work<small>never learns who or why, keeps no memory</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Only the question crosses the boundary. Your identity, your reasons and your history stay on your side.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .zones {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .zone {
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mine {
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .public {
    border: 1px dashed var(--text-3);
  }
  .label {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .box {
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .box small {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  .gate {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .gate small {
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .link {
    display: block;
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .wire {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 11rem;
  }
  .wire p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }
  .arrow {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .zones {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .wire {
      max-width: none;
    }
    .arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }
</style>
